OL,5,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,6,     FAfter a brutally murdered oil rig
OL,7,     Fworker is found in a burnt-out
OL,8,     Fcar, the quiet Scottish town soon
OL,9,     Fbecomes inflamed with rumours and
OL,10,     Ffear.
OL,11,G0100 Murdered at First Sight
OL,12,     FIn 2021, Sean McKay is stabbed in
OL,13,     FStevenston, Scotland, by Gary
OL,14,     FMcVey. Despite help from
OL,15,     Fbystanders, he dies. McVey shows
OL,16,     Fno remorse, later bragging about
OL,17,     Fthe murder.
